<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Socket.IO test – ping/pong</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; }
    #status { margin: 0.5rem 0; padding: 0.5rem; background: #f0f0f0; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; }
    #status.connected { background: #e8f5e9; }
    #status.disconnected { background: #ffebee; }
    button { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; cursor: pointer; }
    button:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: not-allowed; }
    #pong { margin-top: 1rem; padding: 1rem; background: #e3f2fd; border-radius: 6px; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px; min-height: 40px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Socket.IO test</h1>
  <p>Connect to the server, then click Ping to send a message. You should receive a pong back.</p>
  <div id="status">Connecting…</div>
  <button type="button" id="pingBtn" disabled>Ping</button>
  <div id="pong">—</div>

  <script src="/socket.io/socket.io.js"></script>
  <script type="module" src="/js/websocket-test.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
